#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.BossRaidResult"
msgid "Nice work! You've dealt {Damage} damage so far, rank #{Rank}. You can try {Attempts} more times today."
msgstr "お疲れさま！これまでに{Damage}のダメージを与えて{Rank}位です。今日はあと{Attempts}回挑戦できます。"

#. Key:	Title.BossRaidReward
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.BossRaidReward"
msgid "The boss has fallen! You received {Gold} gold for fighting together."
msgstr "ボスが倒れました！一緒に戦った報酬として{Gold}ゴールドを受け取りました。"

